{"id":"c1c6274e797ca25b","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-model8-cover-property.md","title":"ZFC Model8 Cover Property","display":"df-zfc-model8-cover-property — ZFC Model8 Cover Property","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-model8-cover-property","aliases":["58-df-zfc-model8-cover-property","58-df-zfc-model9-cover-property"],"display":"df-zfc-model8-cover-property — ZFC Model8 Cover Property","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-cardinal]]","[[58-df-equinumerous]]","[[58-df-transitive-set]]","[[58-df-satisfaction]]","[[58-df-structure]]","[[58-df-assignment]]","[[58-df-formula]]","[[58-df-free-variable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-model8-cover-property"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-model8-cover-property</span><span>58-df-zfc-model9-cover-property</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-model8-cover-property — ZFC Model8 Cover Property"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"28c79fde9f892bfe\" href=\"?note=28c79fde9f892bfe\" title=\"58-df-equinumerous\">58-df-equinumerous</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c14ba496c480dcd6\" href=\"?note=c14ba496c480dcd6\" title=\"58-df-transitive-set\">58-df-transitive-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"58-df-satisfaction\">58-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"58-df-structure\">58-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"58-df-assignment\">58-df-assignment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"58-df-formula\">58-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"58-df-free-variable\">58-df-free-variable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N,\\kappa,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N,\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\operatorname{Sat}_M,\\operatorname{Val}_N,\\operatorname{Sat}_N\\in V\">\\(M,N,\\kappa,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N,\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\operatorname{Sat}_M,\\operatorname{Val}_N,\\operatorname{Sat}_N\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> are sourced predicates</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}:V\\to V\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}:V\\to V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{rel},2},I^{\\mathcal N}_{\\mathrm{rel},2}\\in V\">\\(I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{rel},2},I^{\\mathcal N}_{\\mathrm{rel},2}\\in V\\)</span> are the sourced carrier and binary-relation interpretation projections</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_\\in,\\mathrm{ZFC}\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal L_\\in,\\mathrm{ZFC}\\in V\\)</span> are the canonical membership language and its set-coded background theory</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_{\\mathrm{card}}(v_0),\\sigma_{&lt;}(v_0,v_1)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\">\\(\\sigma_{\\mathrm{card}}(v_0),\\sigma_{&lt;}(v_0,v_1)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\\)</span> are fixed formula codes expressing, respectively, “<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0\">\\(v_0\\)</span> is a cardinal” and “<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0\">\\(v_0\\)</span> is equinumerous with a cardinal belonging to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_1\">\\(v_1\\)</span>”</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel8CoverProperty}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcModel9CoverProperty}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel8CoverProperty}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcModel9CoverProperty}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_\\in\">\\(\\mathcal L_\\in\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZFC}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZFC}\\)</span> 取所引公理文件的固定代码。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\\)</span> 表示在该语言中将所引集合谓词定义作避捕获展开后取得的公式码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_{\\mathrm{card}}\">\\(\\sigma_{\\mathrm{card}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_{&lt;}\">\\(\\sigma_{&lt;}\\)</span> 不再作为可任意选择的参数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Equinumerous}\">\\(\\mathrm{Equinumerous}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"28c79fde9f892bfe\" href=\"?note=28c79fde9f892bfe\" title=\"58-df-equinumerous\">58-df-equinumerous</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\sigma_{\\mathrm{card}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\ulcorner\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(v_0)\\urcorner,\\\\\n\\sigma_{&lt;}&amp;\\coloneqq\\ulcorner\\exists\\alpha\\;(\\alpha\\in v_1\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S(v_0,\\alpha))\\urcorner.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\sigma_{\\mathrm{card}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\ulcorner\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(v_0)\\urcorner,\\\\\n\\sigma_{&lt;}&amp;\\coloneqq\\ulcorner\\exists\\alpha\\;(\\alpha\\in v_1\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S(v_0,\\alpha))\\urcorner.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model8\\text{-}cover\\text{-}property}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel8CoverProperty}_S(N,M,\\kappa)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(M)\\land\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(N)\\land M\\subseteq N\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\exists\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N,\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\operatorname{Sat}_M,\n\\operatorname{Val}_N,\\operatorname{Sat}_N\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)=M\\land\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal N)=N\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{rel},2}(\\dot\\in)\n=\\{a\\in M^2:a(0)\\in a(1)\\}\n\\land I^{\\mathcal N}_{\\mathrm{rel},2}(\\dot\\in)\n=\\{a\\in N^2:a(0)\\in a(1)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L_\\in,\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\operatorname{Sat}_M)\n\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal N,\\mathcal L_\\in,\\operatorname{Val}_N,\\operatorname{Sat}_N)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{ZFC}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\n\\land\\sigma_{\\mathrm{card}},\\sigma_{&lt;}\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\n\\land\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\sigma_{\\mathrm{card}})\\subseteq\\{v_0\\}\n\\land\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\sigma_{&lt;})\\subseteq\\{v_0,v_1\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\theta\\in\\mathrm{ZFC}\\;\\forall s\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\to\\operatorname{Sat}_M(\\theta,s))\n\\land(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal N,s)\\to\\operatorname{Sat}_N(\\theta,s))\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\exists s_\\kappa\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s_\\kappa)\\land s_\\kappa(v_0)=\\kappa\n\\land\\operatorname{Sat}_M(\\sigma_{\\mathrm{card}},s_\\kappa)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall A\\in N\\;\\Bigl(\nA\\subseteq M\\land\\exists s_N\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal N,s_N)\\land s_N(v_0)=A\\land s_N(v_1)=\\kappa\n\\land\\operatorname{Sat}_N(\\sigma_{&lt;},s_N)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{10em}\\to\\exists B\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\nA\\subseteq B\\land\\exists s_M\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s_M)\\land s_M(v_0)=B\\land s_M(v_1)=\\kappa\n\\land\\operatorname{Sat}_M(\\sigma_{&lt;},s_M)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model8\\text{-}cover\\text{-}property}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel8CoverProperty}_S(N,M,\\kappa)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(M)\\land\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(N)\\land M\\subseteq N\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\exists\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N,\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\operatorname{Sat}_M,\n\\operatorname{Val}_N,\\operatorname{Sat}_N\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)=M\\land\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal N)=N\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{rel},2}(\\dot\\in)\n=\\{a\\in M^2:a(0)\\in a(1)\\}\n\\land I^{\\mathcal N}_{\\mathrm{rel},2}(\\dot\\in)\n=\\{a\\in N^2:a(0)\\in a(1)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L_\\in,\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\operatorname{Sat}_M)\n\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal N,\\mathcal L_\\in,\\operatorname{Val}_N,\\operatorname{Sat}_N)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{ZFC}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\n\\land\\sigma_{\\mathrm{card}},\\sigma_{&lt;}\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\n\\land\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\sigma_{\\mathrm{card}})\\subseteq\\{v_0\\}\n\\land\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\sigma_{&lt;})\\subseteq\\{v_0,v_1\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\theta\\in\\mathrm{ZFC}\\;\\forall s\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\to\\operatorname{Sat}_M(\\theta,s))\n\\land(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal N,s)\\to\\operatorname{Sat}_N(\\theta,s))\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\exists s_\\kappa\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s_\\kappa)\\land s_\\kappa(v_0)=\\kappa\n\\land\\operatorname{Sat}_M(\\sigma_{\\mathrm{card}},s_\\kappa)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall A\\in N\\;\\Bigl(\nA\\subseteq M\\land\\exists s_N\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal N,s_N)\\land s_N(v_0)=A\\land s_N(v_1)=\\kappa\n\\land\\operatorname{Sat}_N(\\sigma_{&lt;},s_N)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{10em}\\to\\exists B\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\nA\\subseteq B\\land\\exists s_M\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s_M)\\land s_M(v_0)=B\\land s_M(v_1)=\\kappa\n\\land\\operatorname{Sat}_M(\\sigma_{&lt;},s_M)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model8\\text{-}cover\\text{-}property} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel9CoverProperty}_S(M,N,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcModel8CoverProperty}_S(N,M,\\kappa)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model8\\text{-}cover\\text{-}property} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel9CoverProperty}_S(M,N,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcModel8CoverProperty}_S(N,M,\\kappa)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Both smallness tests are internal to the indicated transitive model and are expressed by an explicit cardinal/equinumerosity formula rather than the ambiguous operators <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|^N\">\\(|A|^N\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|B|^M\">\\(|B|^M\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The model9 cover-property variant is merged here.</li>\n<li>Metatheoretic predicates such as <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> are no longer passed as though they were object-language formula codes.  Fixed codes, selected satisfaction recursions, and assignments now mediate every internal truth claim.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-equinumerous","status":"resolved","id":"28c79fde9f892bfe","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-equinumerous]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-transitive-set","status":"resolved","id":"c14ba496c480dcd6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-transitive-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"64f35ba2e87964e0","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-assignment]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"715a32e91161b34f","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-free-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-equinumerous","status":"resolved","id":"28c79fde9f892bfe","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{Equinumerous}$ 取 [[58-df-equinumerous]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{Cardinal}$ 取 [[58-df-cardinal]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,N,\\kappa,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N,\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\operatorname{Sat}_M,\\operatorname{Val}_N,\\operatorname{Sat}_N\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Assign}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Univ}:V\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{rel},2},I^{\\mathcal N}_{\\mathrm{rel},2}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_\\in,\\mathrm{ZFC}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma_{\\mathrm{card}}(v_0),\\sigma_{<}(v_0,v_1)\\in\\ma